Per-residue MM/GBSA decomposition for AK-42 binding to ClC-2 (Ma et al. 2023).
&general
  startframe         = {startframe}
  endframe           = {endframe}
  interval           = {interval}
  forcefields        = "leaprc.protein.ff14SB,leaprc.gaff"
  ions_parameters    = 1
  PBRadii            = 3
  temperature        = 310.0
  endpoint_grids     = 0
  exp_ki             = 0.0
  netcdf             = 0
  c2_entropy         = 0
  search_path        = 0
  verbose            = 1
/
&gb
  igb                = {igb}
  saltcon            = 0.150
/
&decomp
  idecomp            = 4
  dec_verbose        = {dec_verbose}
  print_res          = "within 6.0"
/
